    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horny Princess Survivors</strong> is an adult-only Survivor-like game where you step into the heels of daring princesses on a quest to rescue their Prince Charmings. Choose your favourite princess and dive into fast-paced combat against relentless waves of monsters. After each successful mission, upgrade your princess\u2019s skills and witness her unique stress-relief methods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294070/extras/de86e25673b9d4368d8b782a5061a3bb.poster.avif?t=1735898982\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294070/extras/de86e25673b9d4368d8b782a5061a3bb.webm?t=1735898982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294070/extras/de86e25673b9d4368d8b782a5061a3bb.mp4?t=1735898982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PRINCESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each princess comes with distinct abilities and traits, offering a unique play-style for every run. Unlock exclusive, steamy scenes as you guide your chosen princess through her journey to save the princes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294070/extras/1670363f2f18feb78cf5ca516ac5fef4.poster.avif?t=1735898982\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294070/extras/1670363f2f18feb78cf5ca516ac5fef4.webm?t=1735898982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294070/extras/1670363f2f18feb78cf5ca516ac5fef4.mp4?t=1735898982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HOTTEST BULLET HEAVEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine skills and upgrades to transform your princess into an unstoppable force. Mow down hordes of enemies sent by the Evil Witch and carve your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294070/extras/aadada7732be9b85bc53c77a59aa029b.poster.avif?t=1735898982\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294070/extras/aadada7732be9b85bc53c77a59aa029b.webm?t=1735898982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294070/extras/aadada7732be9b85bc53c77a59aa029b.mp4?t=1735898982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR GEAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every run, spend your hard-earned coins to enhance your gear, boosting your chances of surviving the increasingly challenging waves in your next attempt.</p>",
